### Create customer
POST {{customerBaseUrl}}/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Customer",
  "email": "test.customer@example.com",
  "phone": "+905551112233"
}


### Create customer without phone
POST {{customerBaseUrl}}/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Customer Without Phone",
  "email": "no.phone@example.com"
}


### Duplicate email - expect 409
POST {{customerBaseUrl}}/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Duplicate Customer",
  "email": "ahmet.yilmaz@example.com",
  "phone": "+905559999999"
}


### Invalid customer - expect 400
POST {{customerBaseUrl}}/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "email": "invalid-email"
}